{# ---------- Ways to give ---------- #}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="ways-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Ways to give</p>
        <h2 class="section__title" id="ways-title">Choose the way that fits you</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="resource-grid">
      <a class="resource" href="https://socialwork.utexas.edu/give/">
        <h3 class="resource__title">Give online</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">Make a one-time or recurring gift through the School's secure giving page. To direct your gift to global engagement, select the Global Engagement designation if it is listed or write "Office of Global Engagement" in the comments field.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Steve Hicks School of Social Work</span>
        <!-- VERIFY: exact fund / designation name for Global Engagement on the School's giving page. -->
      </a>
      <a class="resource" href="/connect/">
        <h3 class="resource__title">Endow a global practicum scholarship</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">A named endowment provides travel and living support for a student completing a final practicum abroad, year after year. Contact us and we will connect you with the School's development office to design the gift.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Contact OGE</span>
      </a>
      <a class="resource" href="/about/partners/#partner-with-us">
        <h3 class="resource__title">Partner as an institution</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">Universities, agencies and NGOs can host practicum students, co-teach, exchange faculty or collaborate on research. See how our partnerships work and how to start one.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Partner with us</span>
      </a>
      <a class="resource" href="/connect/">
        <h3 class="resource__title">Corporate and foundation partnerships</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">Foundations and companies can fund a cohort, underwrite a signature program or support a research partnership in a region that matters to them. Tell us what you want to achieve and we will propose options.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Contact OGE</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="small muted mt-6">Gifts to the Office of Global Engagement are made to The University of Texas at Austin and are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law. Questions about matching gifts, gifts of stock or planned giving? <a href="/connect/">Contact us</a> and we will route you to the School's development team.</p>
  </div>
</section>

